    76	``|r3|`` over served steps, rounded to the nearest integer".  P3 measured
    77	``|r3|`` over 12,000 decision steps at p05/p50/p95/max = 1 / 3 / **6** / 8,
    78	so the mapping returns **6**.  The number was not chosen after the fact;
    79	the *rule* was frozen and this is what it selected.
    80	
    81	Why p95 and not max: the max is one congested beam, and a divisor that
    82	tracks a single outlier is not a scale.  Why an integer: ``U_{b_u}`` is a
    83	head count, so its scale should stay a countable quantity rather than a
    84	fitted one.
    85	
    86	⚠ Applied through ``TrainerConfig.reward_calibration_*``, which is why that
    87	surface survived P-05 when the other opt-in surfaces went.
    88	
    89	⚠ Measured under the **reference policy** at the frozen scenario.  A trained
    90	policy will spread load differently; the scale is frozen at this value
    91	regardless, because re-deriving it from training output would make the
    92	reward scale a function of the run it is scoring.
    93	"""
